WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.047 --> 00:00:02.318
(laughter)

00:00:02.318 --> 00:00:03.526
- Oh, scratching the butt.

00:00:03.526 --> 00:00:06.693
(playful piano music)

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:09.974
- Hey, I'm Jordan, and my sister Aviva

00:00:09.974 --> 00:00:11.261
is visiting from out of town.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:12.297
There is nobody on the planet

00:00:12.297 --> 00:00:13.727
who loves monkeys more than my sister.

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:16.562
My sister even talked about a
monkey in her wedding speech.

00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:19.800
- Your unconditional
support is like no other.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.154
I mean, you even let me think
I could be a monkey mother.

00:00:23.154 --> 00:00:24.241
(laughter)

00:00:24.241 --> 00:00:26.420
- At her preschool graduation
she said that what she wants

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.009
to be when she grows
up is a mother monkey.

00:00:29.009 --> 00:00:30.103
And when she found out

00:00:30.103 --> 00:00:32.111
she couldn't be one she cried for days.

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:34.056
I officiated my sister's
wedding and I really wanted

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:36.319
to surprise her with a
monkey as the ring bearer

00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:37.964
but we weren't able to work it out there,

00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:40.542
so now I'm gonna surprise
her with a monkey today.

00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:42.459
It's gonna destroy her.

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.318
- [Male Voice] What are
you here to do today?

00:00:47.318 --> 00:00:48.431
- Jordan and I are going to

00:00:48.431 --> 00:00:50.363
transform into each other through make-up.

00:00:50.363 --> 00:00:52.653
He's my little brother,
so it'll be interesting.

00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:54.022
The only thing that we
really look alike in

00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:55.120
is that we both have brown eyes.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.858
I think it's gonna be funny and I think

00:00:56.858 --> 00:00:58.224
it's gonna be awkward for sure.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.103
But if she nails it, then I'm gonna be

00:01:00.103 --> 00:01:02.520
in awe of the make-up artist.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.207
(gasping)

00:01:09.177 --> 00:01:10.427
Oh my goodness.

00:01:13.671 --> 00:01:14.529
- [Male Voice] This is Dexter.

00:01:14.529 --> 00:01:15.716
- Hi Dexter.

00:01:15.716 --> 00:01:16.549
Oh my God!

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:19.616
I love monkeys, I'm so excited!

00:01:19.616 --> 00:01:20.866
Oh my goodness!

00:01:21.987 --> 00:01:23.356
Hi, hi!

00:01:23.356 --> 00:01:24.570
Oh, hello!

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:25.848
Oh, hello!

00:01:25.848 --> 00:01:28.170
This is so awesome, I'm so excited.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.380
I'm sorry, I'm freaking out.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.244
I love monkeys and I never
get to be around them.

00:01:33.244 --> 00:01:34.077
When my husband and I got married

00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:35.720
we had two little monkeys
on top of our cake.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.730
It's always been that I've wanted to do

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.947
is spend time with them.

00:01:38.947 --> 00:01:41.393
Jordan had me convinced I was
here for some other reason.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:43.643
(laughter)

00:01:53.627 --> 00:01:54.557
- There he goes.

00:01:54.557 --> 00:01:55.390
Hey there.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:57.140
- Look, you're a natural!

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.235
- He sneezed on me!

00:01:58.235 --> 00:02:00.485
(laughter)

00:02:04.377 --> 00:02:05.327
- Well, I was super surprised.

00:02:05.327 --> 00:02:07.549
I didn't think Jordan could
surprise me, but he did.

00:02:07.549 --> 00:02:11.337
In fact, I'm just so excited
to be around a monkey.

00:02:11.337 --> 00:02:13.429
So this experience has
been amazing for me.

00:02:13.429 --> 00:02:15.172
I can't say enough.

00:02:15.172 --> 00:02:18.120
I can't stop looking at this monkey.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.473
[Unison] Hi.

00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:21.285
(laughter)

00:02:21.285 --> 00:02:23.898
- This expression when
he did that is amazing.

00:02:23.898 --> 00:02:25.501
- He's awesome, he's full of energy

00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:26.471
and he's awesome.

00:02:26.471 --> 00:02:28.319
I'm jealous that I don't get to keep him.

00:02:28.319 --> 00:02:31.902
Thank you, thank you,
thank you, thank you.

